UnRen-Desktop is a Ren'Py unpack, decompile, and patch tool for Linux and macOS.
It is a desktop port of community Windows tools (UnRen.bat, UnRen-forall) with
updated Python 3 toolchains.

This repository bundles or invokes third-party tools and Ren'Py SDK runtime
slices. Each component remains under its own license. See:

  THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md     — attribution and license summary
  docs/SOURCE_INVENTORY.md    — provenance audit trail
  manifest.json               — pinned versions and compliance metadata
  licenses/                   — per-component license texts for runtime audit
  tools/SOURCES.md            — upstream paths and versions
  tools/forall/ATTRIBUTION.md
  sdk/*/LICENSE.txt           — Ren'Py SDK (per runtime slice)

When redistributing UnRen-Desktop (source or release archives), include this
NOTICE file, LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, and docs/SOURCE_INVENTORY.md.

